ORIGINALITY
- All 32 illustrations are generated from geometric primitives by
  tools/generate-art.mjs, which is part of this repository. No third-party
  images, traces or references were used.
- All sound effects are synthesised at runtime with the Web Audio API. No
  audio files or samples are included.
- No third-party fonts are bundled (system fonts only).
- No code was copied from other games.

